{
    "title": "boohooMAN: Shop Men\u2019s Clothing",
    "description": "Stay one step ahead with the boohooMAN app, bringing you all the latest must-have menswear styles. Score unbeatable deals on men's fashion, from streetwear and tracksuits to going-out gear we\u2019ve always got you covered, plus with our live order tracking, you can trace your new clothes right to your doorstep. Get ready to up your fashion game with these trending outfits that will have you turning heads wherever you go. Pick up some statement trousers, hoodies and printed t-shirts, we've got an outfit for every vibe. It\u2019s time to update your stash with our seasonal selections. We've got 100's of fiercely fresh men's styles and they're just waiting for you to snap 'em up.\r\n\r\nDownload the boohooMAN app now to access exclusive content, deals and games, shop the newest men\u2019s fashion at the touch of a button with our fast and secure checkout, or search and save your favourite looks for later in your wish list.\r\nTake full advantage of:\r\n \r\n\u2022 Exclusive content \u2013 stay up to date on all things active, the latest drops & more.\r\n\u2022 boohooMAN Premier \u2013 get Unlimited Next Day Delivery for a year and exclusive offers.\r\n\u2022 Fast and secure checkout - shop the latest drip with speed and ease.\r\n\u2022 Track your order \u2013 track it to your door.\r\n\u2022 Wishlist \u2013 lock it down for later.\r\n\u2022 Notifications \u2013 hear about exclusive offers and the latest collections before anyone else.\r\n\u2022 MAN Gaming - explore our latest game with ULTIMATE PRIZES to play for. Play multiplayer and join the leaderboard with your friends.\r\n\u2022 Step Challenges - we're using Apple's Health Kit for our Step Challenges.",
